.TH ANIM_SET 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
anim_set \- Switch st to animation anim_id, restarting at its first frame with done cleared
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsprite.h\(dq
.BI "void anim_set(AnimState *st, int anim_id);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Switch st to animation anim_id, restarting at its first frame with done cleared. A no\-op if that animation is already playing, so it is safe to call every tick from the code that decides what the entity is doing (if (moving) anim_set(&st, RUN); else anim_set(&st, IDLE);) without the animation constantly restarting.
.SH MODULE
sprite (src/engine/sprite/sprite.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR anim_step (3),
.BR anim_frame (3),
.BR AnimState (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
